description.en:
CRIT Rate increases by 25%; when the equipper's attack hits an enemy and triggers a Sharp strike, gain 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Enhance]</color>:
Increases the equipper's <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color> by 7%, lasting 20s; stacks up to 3 times. Repeated triggers refresh the duration of all <color=#FFFFFF>[Enhance]</color> stacks. Can trigger at most once every 0.1s;
When at 3 stacks of this effect, additionally increases the equipper's <color=#2EB6FF>Electric Sharp DMG</color> by 12%.

